WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:07.857
View of green plants inside growth chamber; person in black shirt enters, puts on blue gloves, and inspects leaves.

2
00:00:11.379 --> 00:00:17.876
Astronaut in black shirt and white gloves manipulates equipment among green plants inside chamber.

3
00:00:22.678 --> 00:00:28.607
Man in black shirt reaches arm into white panel with green plants; wears blue gloves to tend.

4
00:00:33.977 --> 00:00:40.210
Camera zooms in on gloved hand and face tending plants; close-up of adjusting green leaves.

5
00:00:45.275 --> 00:00:49.794
Man reaches into chamber and adjusts green plants and equipment.

6
00:00:56.574 --> 00:01:01.112
A dried red chili pepper labeled Super Chili is taped to a black surface.

7
00:01:07.873 --> 00:01:13.315
A person wearing blue gloves adjusts a chili pepper and label onto tape on a black board.

8
00:01:32.723 --> 00:01:38.888
HATCH PEPPER CROP ONE. Crew examines green plant, passes it around while one films.
